# Laptop-only packages.
#
# Applied after the shared Brewfile by scripts/init.sh, which picks this file from
# scripts/host-profile.sh.
#
# Empty on purpose. Nothing is laptop-only right now: the Mac mini is not used only over
# SSH -- it gets a display and input devices too -- so the GUI applications, including
# bettertouchtool, belong in the shared Brewfile.
#
# The file is kept rather than deleted so that both profiles resolve to a real file. If
# init.sh had to tolerate a missing one, a mistyped profile would be skipped in silence
# instead of failing, which is the same reason vars/laptop.yml spells out every switch.
